{{infobox Chinese|l=Yang Metal Monkey|kanji=庚申|romaji=kanoe saru|onyomi=kōshin|p=gēngshēn|w=keng-shen|mi=kɤŋ⁵³ ʂən|y=geng1 san1|j=geng1 san1|ci=kɪŋ ʂɐn|mc=kæŋ ʂin|oc-bs=kˤraŋ ʂin}}
