== Gengshen Month ==
In years where the last digit of the Western Calendar year is 3 or 8 (when the heavenly stem is {{ill|Guǐ|ja|癸|1=Mizunoto (癸)|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Guǐ|13=User:Immanuelle/Mizunoto (癸)|qq=}} or {{ill|Wu|ja|戊|1=Tsuchinoe (戊)|lt=Tsuchinoe (戊)|2=ja|3=戊|4=zh|5=戊|1=Tsuchinoe (戊)|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Wu|13=User:Immanuelle/Tsuchinoe (戊)|qq=}}), the month of {{ill|July|ja|7月|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/July|qq=}} becomes the Gengshen {{ill|Month (Calendar)|ja|月 (暦)|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Month (Calendar)|qq=}}. Note that here the month may refer either to a month of the {{ill|Japanese Lunisolar Calendar|ja|旧暦|1=Japanese Lunisolar Calendar|1=Japanese Lunisolar Calendar|11=Japanese Lunisolar Calendar|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Japanese Lunisolar Calendar|13=User:Immanuelle/Japanese Lunisolar Calendar|qq=}} or to a {{ill|Seasonal Month|ja|節月|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Seasonal Month|qq=}} (from {{ill|Start of Autumn|ja|立秋|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Start of Autumn|qq=}} until the day before {{ill|White Dew|ja|白露|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/White Dew|qq=}}).

== Gengshen Day ==
On Gengshen days, a Gengshen Vigil ({{ill|Gengshen Vigil|ja|庚申待|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Gengshen Vigil|qq=}}, also known as  {{ill|Gengshen Lecture|ja|庚申講|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Gengshen Lecture|qq=}}) was held. {{main|{{ill|Gengshen Faith|ja|庚申信仰|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Gengshen Faith|qq=}}|qq=}}

A Gengshen day is also the {{ill|Festival Day|ja|縁日|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Festival Day|qq=}} of {{ill|Taishakuten|ja|帝釈天|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Taishakuten|qq=}}.

=== Choosing a Day ===
Gengshen days occur on the sixth day (excluding intercalary days {{ill|Intercalary Day|ja|間日|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Intercalary Day|qq=}}) of the {{ill|Hassen|ja|八専|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Hassen|qq=}} cycle.
