=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/2700 years|qq=}} * {{ill|2760 years|ja|2760年|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/2760 years|qq=}} * {{ill|2820 years|ja|2820年|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/2820 years|qq=}} * {{ill|2880 years|ja|2880年|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/2880 years|qq=}} * {{ill|2940 years|ja|2940年|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/2940 years|qq=}} * {{ill|3000 years|ja|3000年|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/3000 years|qq=}} |}
== Kōshin Month == In years where the last digit of the Western Calendar year is 3 or 8 (when the heavenly stem is {{ill|Guǐ|ja|癸|1=Mizunoto (癸)|lt=Mizunoto (癸)|2=ja|3=癸|4=zh|5=癸|1=Mizunoto (癸)|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Guǐ|13=User:Immanuelle/Mizunoto (癸)|qq=}} or {{ill|Wu|ja|戊|1=Tsuchinoe (戊)|lt=Tsuchinoe (戊)|2=ja|3=戊|4=zh|5=戊|1=Tsuchinoe (戊)|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Wu|13=User:Immanuelle/Tsuchinoe (戊)|qq=}}), the month of [[:en:July|July]] becomes the Kōshin [[:en:Month|Month (Calendar)]]. Note that here the month may refer either to a month of the {{ill|Japanese Lunisolar Calendar|ja|旧暦|1=Japanese Lunisolar Calendar|1=Japanese Lunisolar Calendar|11=Japanese Lunisolar Calendar|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Japanese Lunisolar Calendar|13=User:Immanuelle/Japanese Lunisolar Calendar|qq=}} or to a [[:en:Solar term|Solar term]] (from [[:en:Liqiu|Start of Autumn]] until the day before [[:en:Bailu (solar term)|White Dew]]).
== Kōshin Day == On Kōshin days, a Kōshin Vigil ({{ill|Kōshin Vigil|ja|庚申待|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kōshin Vigil|qq=}}, also known as {{ill|Kōshin Lecture|ja|庚申講|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kōshin Lecture|qq=}}) was held. {{main|[[:en:Kōshin|Kōshin Faith]]|qq=}}
A Kōshin day is also the [[:en:Ennichi|Festival Day]] of [[:en:Śakra (Buddhism)|Taishakuten]].
=== Choosing a Day === Kōshin days occur on the sixth day (excluding intercalary days {{ill|Intercalary Day|ja|間日|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Intercalary Day|qq=}}) of the {{ill|Hassen|ja|八専|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Hassen|qq=}} cycle. == See Also == * {{prefix|qq=}} * {{intitle|qq=}}
